    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebbaruha Yeremiya ei yahandiikiire Abazaahisiibwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 24:12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 36:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo ebigambo eby'ebbaruha Yeremiya omurangi ali Yerusaalemu ei yatwekiire abakuru b'enzaahisibwa, banyakatagara, abarangi n'abantu boona Nebbukadaneza aba yaihire Yerusaalemu, yabazaahisiza Bbabbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebbaruha enu ekahandiikwa omukama Yekoniya nyina omukama, abagaragara, abantu abakuru aba Yuda na Yerusaalemu, abafundi n'abaheesi b'ebyoma, bamazire kuruga Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erasa mutabani wa Safani, na Gemaliya mutabani wa Hirikiya, Zedekiya omukama wa Yuda aba yatwekere Bbabbulooni hali Nebbukadaneeza omukama, nubo baagitwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enzaahisibwa boona aba naihire Yerusaalemu nabazaahisiza Bbabbulooni, MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga owa Isirairi naabagamba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwombeke amaju mugaraalemu; mulime emisiri, mulye ebyokulya ebirukuruga omu misiri egi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muswere abakazi, muzaale abaana aboojo n'abaisiki; muswererre batabani banyu, kandi bahara banyu mubasweeze, nabo nukwo bazaale abaana aboojo n'abaisiki, mukanye omunsi egi, baitu muleke kukeeha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murwanirre obusinge obw'orubuga oru nabazaahisiizaamu, kandi murusabire hali MUKAMA, habwokuba oburulitunga obusinge, na inywe nubwo mulitunga obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati: Abarangi n'abafumu banyu aba muli nabo, baleke kubabiiha, kandi muleke kwikiriza ebirooto ebi barukuroota, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba MUKAMA naagamba ati, nibabarangira ebisuba omu ibara lyange; ntabatume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
